    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Magnet Jack is an action-oriented puzzle-platformer. It has a fast-changing assortment of game mechanics, and a top-down overworld with <i>off-the-wall</i>\u00a0themes and characters. Alright!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491800/extras/29c0cef8373e7f1d6779bee151b50fa4.poster.avif?t=1745459548\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491800/extras/29c0cef8373e7f1d6779bee151b50fa4.webm?t=1745459548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491800/extras/29c0cef8373e7f1d6779bee151b50fa4.mp4?t=1745459548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491800/extras/06a5d87fc6efe5557cdf34e1c2e6c462.poster.avif?t=1745459548\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491800/extras/06a5d87fc6efe5557cdf34e1c2e6c462.webm?t=1745459548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491800/extras/06a5d87fc6efe5557cdf34e1c2e6c462.mp4?t=1745459548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE OVERWORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The overworld is similar to good old Super Italian Siblings 3. YOU KNOW THE ONE. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clear stages to unlock paths. Invade character houses, ride a boat, fight bosses, find secrets.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Magnet Jack is all about:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A large variety of mechanics, like <strong>MARIO</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Action-oriented puzzles, like <strong>WARIO</strong>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The quick retry of <strong>MEATBOY</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">180<strong>+</strong> stages. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secrets &amp; Surprises </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u1d3a\u1d52 \u02b3\u1d49\u02e1\u1d43\u1d57\u1da6\u1d52\u207f \u1d57\u1d52 &quot;\u1d9c\u1d52\u1d52\u02e1 \u02e2\u1d56\u1d52\u1d57&quot; \u207d \u1d39\u1d43\u02b8\u1d47\u1d49 \u1d43 \u02e1\u1da6\u1d57\u1d57\u02e1\u1d49 \u207e \u207d \u1d3a\u1d52\u1d57 \u02b3\u1d49\u1d43\u02e1\u02e1\u02b8 \u1d48\u1d52\u207f'\u1d57 \u02e2\u1d58\u1d49 \u1d50\u1d49 \u207e</p></li></ul>",
